===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|halle}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|halla}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*hallō}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱel-||to hide, cover, conceal}}. Compare Low German {{m|nds|Hall}}, Dutch {{m|nl|hal}}, English {{m|en|hall}}, Danish and Swedish {{m|sv|hall}}.

